# Credentials

Commands needing credentials run through the `faramir_run` MCP tool (CLI:
`faramir run`). Secrets are referenced by name; values are never available here
and output comes back with them replaced by `«SECRET:ref»`.

```
faramir_run(cmd=["ansible-playbook", "site.yml", "--limit", "routers"],
            env_refs={"ROUTER_PW": "secret://home/router/admin"})
```

`faramir_list_secrets` lists available names. The broker executes only committed
work from `/srv/ansible-ctrl`: commit, then `faramir_sync`, then run.
